#ASSERT `is a working day` (ymd 2020 6 8) `according to` (calOf (ymd 2020 2 6) (ymd 2020 4 10) (ymd 2020 4 13) (ymd 2020 4 24) (ymd 2020 6 6) (ymd 2020 7 10) (ymd 2020 10 26)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
