-- S91c a circumstance after commencement
#ASSERT `whether the legislation applies to a circumstance that arose on` (ymd 2020 8 1) `when it came into force on` (ymd 2020 1 1) `and it provides otherwise` FALSE EQUALS `The legislation applies`
